    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\n**DNG 3D VIRTUAL TOUR OF THIS PROPERTY AVAILABLE** \n\nDNG are delighted to present to the market 37 Llewellyn Court, a superb three-bedroom family home which has been thoughtfully upgraded and extended by its current owners. \n\nIdeally positioned in a quiet cul-de-sac, within this mature and highly regarded residential development, this impressive property offers well-proportioned accommodation throughout, complemented by a stylish interior, excellent living space and a number of valuable additions, including a converted attic and a recently added garden room currently in use as a home office. \n\nThe accommodation comprises a welcoming entrance hall with guest WC off, a comfortable reception room and a superb open-plan kitchen/dining/living area which provides the perfect heart of the home with direct access to the rear garden. A utility room located off the open plan living area completes the accommodation on the ground floor. \n\nUpstairs, there are three well-proportioned bedrooms (two doubles and one single) together with a family bathroom, while the attic has been converted to provide an additional versatile space. \n\nTo the rear, the property enjoys a beautifully maintained private garden, providing an excellent outdoor space for relaxing, entertaining and family enjoyment. A particular feature is the newly constructed garden room, currently in use as a home office, offering the perfect solution for those working from home or requiring additional flexible space. \n\nIdeally located, 37 Llewellyn Court is close to a wealth of amenities including local shops, schools, colleges, churches and excellent public transport links. There is an abundance of sporting and recreational facilities nearby, including Marley Park, St. Enda's Park and Ballinteer St. John's GAA, while both Dundrum Town Centre and Nutgrove Shopping Centre are both just a short walk away. The property also enjoys easy access to Dublin City Centre, with a number of bus routes serving the surrounding area, while the M50 motorway is also within easy reach. The Luas at Balally is also within walking distance."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nGROUND FLOOR - \n\n\nEntrance Hall - \nWith timber floor and Guest WC & understairs storage off\n\nLiving Room - 4.29m x 3.31m\nOverlooking front garden with timber floor and stylish built-in unit\n\nKitchen/Living/Dining Room - 6.82m x 5.26m\nImpressive open-plan family space with high ceilings and direct access to rear garden via sliding doors. Bespoke fitted kitchen with quartz worktops, premium integrated appliances, large central island, timber floors, skylights, and stylish vertical radiator\n\nUtility Room - \nWith built-in units\n\nFIRST FLOOR - \n\n\nLanding - \nWith stairs to attic\n\nBedroom 1 - 3.91m x 3.18m\nLarge double bedroom with built-in wardrobes\n\nBedroom 2 - 3.47m x 3.18m\nLarge double bedroom with built-in wardrobes\n\nBedroom 3 - 2.06m x 1.97m\nSpacious single bedroom, overlooking front garden\n\nFamily Bathroom - 1.79m x 2.51m\nFully tiled bathroom with WC, WHB and bath; heated towel rail\n\nSECOND FLOOR - \n\n\nAttic Room - 3.46m x 5.26m\nConverted to a high standard in recent years and would lend itself to any number of uses.\n\nWC - \nFully tiled with WC & WHB\n\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li> Outstanding three-bedroom semi-detached family home</li><li> Fully modernised and extended in recent years.</li><li> Converted attic providing additional versatile space.</li><li> Recently installed garden room currently in use as a home office</li><li> Turnkey condition</li><li> Stylish and very tasteful décor</li><li> Off-street parking</li><li> GFCH</li><li> Total overall floor area c. 118 sqm to include attic.</li><li> Highly regarded development with a number of green areas</li><li> Double-glazed windows</li><li> Side Access</li><li> Quiet cul de sac - peaceful setting</li><li> Just a stroll to Marley Park</li><li> Approx. 20 Minute walk to Dundrum & Luas</li><li> Excellent location close to all amenities</li><li> Quick and easy access to the M50</ul>"
      },
